# Supabase personal access token and the service role key. Tracked nowhere.
# toolchain/apk-build.env is deliberately NOT the place for either: it is
# tracked, and the anon key it holds is only harmless because it already ships
# inside both apps. A PAT committed here would be a live credential on a public
# branch, and it can deploy functions and run SQL as the project owner.
toolchain/supabase-admin.env
